" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carry it. Those ticks make no scheduling decision, rather than matching breaks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the system clock — which runs ahead of the live playhead by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream’s latency and would fire a break early (PLAYG-360).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"backstop, not a fixed delay"}]},{"type":"text","text":". The SDK stops waiting at whichever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comes first: content has been playing for ~1s and still exposes no PDT (direct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evidence about the stream — "},{"code":"DA-PDT-MISSING","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is emitted once and the clock"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes over immediately, so a join-in-progress break is not delayed below the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tune-in minimum), or this window elapses (the backstop for a player that never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"starts)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to fall back to the system clock immediately. Has no effect on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"pts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"-timebase manifests. Mirrors the web ","type":"text"},{"code":"pdtGraceSeconds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK/OptiViewAds":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OptiViewAds","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewads","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAds","type":"topic","title":"OptiView